WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.489 --> 00:00:03.510
This is absolutely fascinating and infuriating.

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:08.349
And I want to be super careful here to ensure
that I'm not violating any guidelines on any

00:00:08.349 --> 00:00:09.650
of our platforms.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:15.700
We finally found one example of what the right
has been calling dead people voting.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.810
And of course, it wasn't a dead person.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:20.740
It was a live person doing something illegal.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.150
A pro Trump, Pennsylvania man has been charged
with voter fraud for casting a ballot for

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.780
Donald Trump under his dead mother's name.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.939
I'm going to get into the details in a moment.

00:00:30.939 --> 00:00:36.760
But remember, the voter fraud Trump crowd
for seven weeks now has been saying hundreds

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:41.250
of thousands of dead people voted for Joe
Biden in the 2012 election.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.670
In some cases, they say tens of thousands.

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.920
When this was investigated, it turned out
that it happened essentially.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.920
Not at all.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:52.710
Most of the people listed as dead in, I believe
it was in Michigan were just alive.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:56.810
I mean, that that's really they were people
who did vote, but they're alive.

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:58.400
They're not dead.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.420
Others were registered.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.710
They died since registering and they didn't
vote.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:08.170
So in other words, they showed up as registered
because they were but they died and didn't

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.439
vote because dead people can't vote, as some
others were.

00:01:11.439 --> 00:01:18.520
Name confusion, a junior voting, and then
it being counted as their dad's vote senior

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:19.840
who has passed away.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:21.299
But it was still only one vote counted.

00:01:21.299 --> 00:01:23.229
It wasn't it being counted twice for one person.

00:01:23.229 --> 00:01:25.049
It's a clerical error.

00:01:25.049 --> 00:01:30.219
And of course, the implication always was
that this was part of a scam to help Joe Biden

00:01:30.219 --> 00:01:34.590
steal the election, another claim they didn't
have any evidence for.

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:38.909
Aside from the fact that it's really a bad
strategy to steal an election.

00:01:38.909 --> 00:01:42.170
It's so much work for one vote in this way.

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:46.430
But we finally found out that somebody did
do this.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:51.819
And it is a 70 year old man named Bruce Bertman
in Pennsylvania who registered his dead mother

00:01:51.819 --> 00:01:56.750
and his dead mother in law to vote using the
online registration portal, registered them

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:02.070
both as Republicans requested absentee ballots
in their names and returned one of the absentee

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.319
ballots for his deceased mother.

00:02:04.319 --> 00:02:05.490
Voting for Trump.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.490
He's confessed.

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:11.230
He made a statement to the DA's office saying
he cast a vote for his in the name of his

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.640
dead mother for Donald Trump.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.260
And there are many takeaways here.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:20.440
First of all, the claim from the Trump is
that this is widespread is a fantasy.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:25.620
Pennsylvania received hundreds of tips about
supposedly dead voters.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:29.560
They followed up on all of them and they found
one and the guy voted for Trump.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:35.330
OK, number two, the story from the right is
always that it's Democrats doing the voter

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:36.330
fraud.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:41.090
And yet every time it's investigated, every
election, it's a handful of Republicans doing

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.090
it.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.070
There was a similar story back in 2016, maybe
2018, maybe both.

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:49.570
There were scary generalizations about voter
fraud.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:56.180
But when we found the few instances of people
doing it earnestly, it was Republicans.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:01.070
We found instances of Republicans testing
the system, trying to vote twice, and they

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:02.360
got caught.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:08.040
And once again here, 70 year old Republican
caught submitting a ballot for Trump in the

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.770
name of his dead mother.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:15.260
One other Republican in Pennsylvania was also
charged for casting a ballot in person, went

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:20.680
home, put on sunglasses, went back to the
polling place and claimed to be his own son

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.440
to vote a second time.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.440
He's also been caught and charged.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:29.690
So, again, no evidence of materially relevant
voter fraud.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:34.190
But these two guys accused of individual fraud,
which, of course, would not have affected

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.540
the Pennsylvania results.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:39.750
Either way, Joe Biden won by seventy one thousand
votes.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:44.820
But the two instances where people voting
for Trump anyway, so it only took seven weeks,

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:50.890
but we finally found one supposedly dead voter
and it was a Trump vote anyway.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:53.620
So do not fall for this stuff, my friends.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.170
It really will rot your brain.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.240
We have real problems to deal with in this
country.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.820
We have real election problems and they include
some.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:04.790
And closing of polling places, disenfranchisement
of different kinds.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.850
We have a long list of dead people voting,
not a problem.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.850
One guy did it.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.420
He got caught in Pennsylvania.

